license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/marcelotadeumarchi-fgv/qidres-win-audit"
abstract: >-
  Audit of the QIDres informed-trading measure (Barardehi, Dixon and Liu,
  "Detecting Informed Trading Risk from Undercutting Activity", Journal of
  Finance) on market-by-order data for the B3 mini-index future WINV25, 12
  trading sessions (15-30 September 2025). Includes a book-reconstruction
  engine per matching event, the audit specification, synthetic tests, the
  report, a run log with approved deviations and a pre-registration, and
  small derived results. Raw exchange data is not included.
keywords:
  - market microstructure
  - informed trading
  - undercutting
  - QIDres
  - adverse selection
  - tick size
  - B3
  - futures
  - market-by-order
